'''Anti-Genonian sentiment''', also known as '''Genophobia''', is fear or dislike of [[Geno]], [[Genonian people|its people]], and [[Culture of Geno|its culture]]. Its opposite is [[Genophilia]]. 

Opposition to [[transhumanism]] has largely shaped anti-Genonian sentiment throughout [[Basis]].

